WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.945
LAG is used when a question contains words such as
previous change or time since

00:00:06.683 --> 00:00:12.272
The current row remains in the result LAG retrieves
a value from an

00:00:12.298 --> 00:00:18.253
earlier row in the defined order Partitioning
prevents one patient's sequence

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:24.155
from mixing with another patient's sequence The
order is part of the definition

00:00:24.181 --> 00:00:24.997
of previous
